==Event Information==
The Battle Cats continues it's lovable rampage across the globe with its {{Color|#FF00FF|'''20 MILLIONTH DOWNLOAD!'''}}<br>
Help us celebrate this breakthrough with our special campaign, on from Sept. 1st - 17th!

{{Color|#FF6600|● 20 MILLION DOWNLOADS Event Stages, on now!!}}<br>
・{{Color|#FF00FF|20 Million Downloads Celebration Gift!}}<br>
Oodles and oodles of spectacular gifts, including Normal and Rare Tickets!

{{Color|#FF00FF|20 Million Downloads Hard++ Carnivals!}}<br>
The baddest of the bad are here again! Dare you challenge these Hard++ stages?<br>
Master these levels to get Rare Ticket rewards!
<nowiki>*</nowiki>If the stages do not appear, please upgrade the app to its most recent version and check again.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Monthly All-Star Stages!'''}}<br>
All of the toughest baddies from the Monthly Stages have banded together to take down the Cats in these special Hard+++ stages!<br>
Claim mountains of XP by conquering these super-tough stages with style!<br>
Clear the stages again for a set chance to get more XP!

・{{Color|#FF00FF|Monthly Event All-Star Special Anniversary!}}<br>
Event Dates: Sept. 1st - 17th (until 11:00)<br>
・{{Color|#FF00FF|Monthly Event All-Star Ultra Anniversary!}}<br>
Event Dates: Sept. 5th - 17th (until 11:00)<br>
・{{Color|#FF00FF|Monthly Event All-Star Miracle Anniversary!}}<br>
Event Dates: Sept. 9th - 17th (until 11:00)<br>
・{{Color|#FF00FF|Monthly Event All-Star Celebration!}}<br>
Event Dates: Sept. 13th - 17th (until 11:00)<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki>If the stages do not appear, please upgrade the app to its most recent version and check again.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Limited-Edition Units Available Rare Capsules!'''}}<br>
Featuring the limited-edition units {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Gold Cat, Neneko, and Cat Base Mini.'''}}<br>
Plus, the brand-new Super Rare character {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Metal Cat!'''}}<br>
Don't miss this chance to add these cool Cats to your collection!<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki>You must update your app to the recent version to collect these Cats.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Bonus gifts Every Day!'''}}<br>
Visit The Battle Cats anytime during this event to get one free {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Rare Ticket!'''}}<br>
Get a variety of cool items as bonus gifts by logging in each day!<br>
9/1 - 9/4: {{Color|#FF00FF|'''30 Cat Food'''}} each day!<br>
9/5 - 9/8: {{Color|#FF00FF|'''1 Cat CPU'''}} each day!<br>
9/9 - 9/12: {{Color|#FF00FF|'''1 Cat Ticket'''}} each day!<br>
9/13 - 9/17: {{Color|#FF00FF|'''1 Speed Up'''}} each day!

